<%- include('head') %><%- include('header') %><main id="main" class="page-container">
<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / THE WRITING ROOM</p><h1>JOURNAL<span>文章手记</span></h1><p>写下走过的弯路，留住想明白的瞬间。</p></div><div class="entry-count"><b><%= String(all.length).padStart(2,'0') %></b><span>ENTRIES & COUNTING</span></div></div>
<div class="journal-grid"><section aria-label="文章列表"><form class="search-form" action="<%= withBase('/journal') %>" method="get"><label class="sr-only" for="search">搜索文章全文</label><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="search" name="q" type="search" value="<%= q %>" placeholder="搜索标题、正文或关键词…"><% if(category){ %><input type="hidden" name="category" value="<%= category %>"><% } %><% if(tag){ %><input type="hidden" name="tag" value="<%= tag %>"><% } %><% if(series){ %><input type="hidden" name="series" value="<%= series %>"><% } %><button type="submit">搜索 ↵</button></form>
<nav class="filters" aria-label="文章分类"><a href="<%= withBase('/journal') %>" class="<%= !category&&!tag&&!series?'active':'' %>">全部 <small><%= all.length %></small></a><% for(const c of categories){ %><a class="<%= category===c?'active':'' %>" href="<%= withBase('/journal') %>?category=<%= encodeURIComponent(c) %>"><%= c %></a><% } %></nav>
<% if(q||tag||series||category){ %><p class="filter-result"><%= [q,tag,series,category].filter(Boolean).join(' / ') %> · 找到 <%= posts.length %> 篇 <a href="<%= withBase('/journal') %>">清除筛选 ×</a></p><% } %><%- include('post-list') %></section>
<aside class="journal-aside"><div class="side-note"><span class="micro">A CONTINUING STORY</span><span class="series-symbol" aria-hidden="true">{ ↗ }</span><h2>构建自己的<br>Agent</h2><p>从 150 行脚本开始，记录一个 Agent 逐渐拥有自己的运行时、记忆与边界。</p><a href="<%= withBase('/journal') %>?series=<%= encodeURIComponent('构建自己的 Agent') %>">阅读整个系列 <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="side-topics"><span class="micro">EXPLORE BY TOPIC</span><div class="tag-cloud"><% for(const t of [...new Set(all.flatMap(p=>p.tags))]){ %><a href="<%= withBase('/journal') %>?tag=<%= encodeURIComponent(t) %>"><%= t %> <span>↗</span></a><% } %></div></div><div class="rss-note"><span>✳</span><h3>保持连接</h3><p>用 RSS 订阅新的记录。<br>没有算法，只有更新。</p><a href="<%= withBase('/feed.xml') %>">订阅 RSS ↗</a></div></aside></div></main><%- include('footer') %>
